# Homepage must stay static

`/` is served from the Vercel CDN via ISR (`export const revalidate = 3600` in
`src/app/page.tsx`). Per-request SSR re-parses every brand catalogue and cold
starts hit ~15s TTFB (Sep 2026 incident).

- Never call `cookies()`, `headers()`, `draftMode()`, `connection()` or read
  `searchParams` in `src/app/layout.tsx` or any server component it renders
  (`SiteHeader`, `SiteFooter`, …). That forces the whole site dynamic.
- User-specific UI in the shell goes client-side. Cart badge =
  `HeaderCartCount` reading the non-httpOnly `briq-cart-n` cookie, written by
  `writeCartLines` (backfill: `GET /api/cart/count`).
- Cart server actions must not `revalidatePath("/", "layout")` — it purges
  every cached page on each cart edit.
- Do not add `dynamic = "force-dynamic"` / `revalidate = 0` to `src/app/page.tsx`.
- `npm run build` runs `scripts/check-static-home.mjs`; if it fails, fix the
  cause instead of removing the guard.
